       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. QPSG12.
      * SIGNATURE CARD - CLOSURE DELAY PENALTY
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       COPY QPSGF12.
       01  WS-PRODUCT-CODE           PIC X(1) VALUE SPACE.
       01  WS-WORK-DAYS-OPEN         PIC 9(3) VALUE ZERO.
       01  WS-CAL-DAYS-LATE          PIC 9(3) VALUE ZERO.
       01  WS-OUTSTANDING            PIC 9(9)V99 VALUE ZERO.
       01  WS-PENALTY                PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE ZERO.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       1000-MAIN.
           ACCEPT WS-PRODUCT-CODE
           ACCEPT WS-WORK-DAYS-OPEN
           ACCEPT WS-CAL-DAYS-LATE
           ACCEPT WS-OUTSTANDING
           CALL 'QPSGK12' USING WS-PRODUCT-CODE WS-QPSG-PEN-CTL
           IF QPSG-PEN-ON
              PERFORM 2000-PENALTY
           END-IF
           DISPLAY 'PENALTY: ' WS-PENALTY
           STOP RUN.
       2000-PENALTY.
      * CAL-DAYS-LATE: CALENDAR DAYS SINCE THE 7-WORKING-DAY WINDOW.
           MOVE ZERO TO WS-PENALTY
           IF WS-WORK-DAYS-OPEN > 7 AND WS-OUTSTANDING = ZERO
              COMPUTE WS-PENALTY = 500 * WS-CAL-DAYS-LATE
           END-IF.
